Package: sblr
Type: Package
Title: Scalable Bayesian Linear Regression Models
Version: 0.1.0
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
Authors@R: person("Peter", "Sørensen", email = "peter.sorensen@r-qgg.org",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Experimental tools for scalable Bayesian linear regression
    models in genomic prediction and variable selection. The package includes
    R wrappers and C++ implementations for Bayesian models using genome-wide
    association study summary statistics, sparse linkage disequilibrium
    matrices, PLINK BED genotype files, and annotation-informed priors.
URL: https://github.com/psoerensen/sblr,
    https://psoerensen.github.io/sblr/
BugReports: https://github.com/psoerensen/sblr/issues
License: GPL-3
